                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "Every morning I eat a bowl of <w>quark</w> with fresh fruit and nuts for breakfast."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "Voor dit recept heb je vijfhonderd gram magere <w>kwark</w> nodig om de taart luchtig te maken.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "For this recipe, you need five hundred grams of low-fat <w>quark</w> to make the cake light and airy."
